  cardText: '(stand-in until Grandma''s own card is added)


    Canned Tomatoes


    Core
    the tomatoes and cut them in quarters. Pack them into the jars raw, pressing
    down until their own juice fills in around them. Leave half an inch at the top.


    A
    spoonful of lemon juice in every pint. Don''t skip it.


    Lids on and into
    the water bath. Pints take 85 minutes.'
